By reading, 67fb… matches those literals:
- format moriarty-c2-issue-artifacts/2;
- the 12 result keys;
- the 16 labels, with values and order equal to S34;
- 11 stages;
- 7 host APIs called by attribute.
The S33 and S34 pins in R4 equal the packet pins.

